<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Ateli | Safe Four Wheeler Transport
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches during car transportation in Ateli?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp carriers feature padded loading decks, wheel‑harness locking, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings that secure the vehicle without contact points. Each car undergoes a pre‑move inspection checklist, followed by a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging protocol. Real‑time GPS monitoring and a dedicated quality‑control officer oversee the journey, guaranteeing a zero‑scratch outcome.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book vehicle transport from Ateli to a major hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers must provide a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued photo ID, a signed transport agreement, and a GST‑compliant invoice if corporate reimbursement is needed. For new car delivery India, the original purchase invoice is also accepted. All paperwork is digitized and linked to the e‑Way bill for seamless customs and tax compliance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for car transportation in Ateli calculated and what factors influence it?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is derived from four primary factors: total road distance, vehicle dimensions (length, height, weight), chosen service tier (standard, express, or premium), and insurance coverage level. Additional considerations include seasonal fuel surcharge, toll exemptions, and any special handling like open‑carrier versus enclosed container. Our instant quote engine transparently displays each component.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car in real time while it travels from Ateli to the destination?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every Shree Ashirwad carrier is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that feeds live location data to our customer portal. Users receive minute‑by‑minute updates, geofencing alerts, and estimated arrival times. The tracking interface also logs temperature and vibration metrics, ensuring the vehicle’s safety throughout transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for car shifting services and what does the 100% guarantee cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While insurance is optional, we strongly recommend the IRDAI‑approved 100 % marine transit policy for complete protection. The guarantee covers total loss, accidental damage, theft, and any transit‑related scratches. In the unlikely event of a claim, the policy reimburses the full declared value of the vehicle without depreciation, ensuring total peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
